# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SECURITY HEADERS — served by Cloudflare Workers Assets
#
#  WHY THIS FILE EXISTS, AND WHY next.config.ts ALONE IS NOT ENOUGH.
#
#  wrangler.jsonc binds `.open-next/assets` as ASSETS, and Cloudflare serves a
#  matching static file DIRECTLY from that layer without ever invoking the
#  Worker. THIS FILE IS WHAT COVERS THOSE RESPONSES; a `headers()` block in
#  next.config.ts runs inside the Worker and never reaches them, which is how
#  the site once went out with no security headers at all on the pages
#  visitors load and scored 5/100 on Observatory. next.config.ts now parses
#  this file so the Worker sends the same set — with one exception it
#  enforces there: the Content-Security-Policy is NOT lifted.
#
#  The reason is that OpenNext keeps no HTML here (`find .open-next/assets
#  -name '*.html'` comes back empty): every document is rendered by the
#  Worker, where middleware.ts answers it with a per-request nonce. Sending
#  this policy as well only added a second one — Cloudflare comma-joins them
#  and the browser enforces the intersection. So the policy below governs
#  scripts, styles, fonts and images served from the asset layer;
#  middleware.ts governs documents. Keep a directive a document needs in
#  BOTH, or it will not be in effect where it matters.
#
#  script-src is deliberately `'self'` with no `'unsafe-inline'`: nothing the
#  asset layer serves is a document, so nothing here needs an inline
#  allowance, and a policy that grants one anyway is read as the app's script
#  policy by anyone scanning it.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-XSS-Protection: 0
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.anthropic.com; upgrade-insecure-requests
